{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zuck Corp has Hooliland city on full lockdown. We need you in the rebellion to free it!</i><br><i>Each run your aim is to defeat the goals and objectives of increasingly harder zones until the final boss. </i> <br><i>Play from third person perspective as solo or with a squad of up to 4 players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Back Your Turf</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/63737aed6e7c2de943f70cac4593085a.poster.avif?t=1771845175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/63737aed6e7c2de943f70cac4593085a.webm?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/63737aed6e7c2de943f70cac4593085a.mp4?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Clear the zones containing different threats and objectives before time runs out.</i><br><i>Defeat MetaZuckBot or die trying!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skateboard The City</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/79f819265385dd8b81d165b5fe78b0d3.poster.avif?t=1771845175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/79f819265385dd8b81d165b5fe78b0d3.webm?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/79f819265385dd8b81d165b5fe78b0d3.mp4?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use the skateboard for moving faster and dodging enemies. </i><br><i>Show off with tricks to fill your speedboost meter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whacky Weapons</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/bec6ea0a5029287191642b263f5b59d7.poster.avif?t=1771845175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/bec6ea0a5029287191642b263f5b59d7.webm?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/bec6ea0a5029287191642b263f5b59d7.mp4?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utilize anything from a toilet plunger sniper to carrot daggers: the weapon arsenal covers all ranges.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2ddbaf72bf4cde1ef0d86c628a6d89a7.poster.avif?t=1771845175\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2ddbaf72bf4cde1ef0d86c628a6d89a7.webm?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2ddbaf72bf4cde1ef0d86c628a6d89a7.mp4?t=1771845175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your playstyle and drip!  Blast enemies, loot crafting materials or sabotage corporate property.</i> <br>Mix up your upgrades each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>"